  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "In the middle of the continent lies a desert that kept the world out for a century.",
      "shot": 0,
      "at": 0.25,
      "seconds": 4.66
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Fifteen hundred miles of it are marked out in bones.",
      "shot": 1,
      "at": 5.417,
      "seconds": 4.34
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "On the fourth of May, 1847, one man stood on the northern slope and looked for water.",
      "shot": 2,
      "at": 10.292,
      "seconds": 6.13
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "He was not old. Hunger and thirst had done the work of thirty years on him.",
      "shot": 3,
      "at": 16.958,
      "seconds": 5.63
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "He set down his rifle, and the grey bundle off his shoulder, harder than he meant to.",
      "shot": 4,
      "at": 23.125,
      "seconds": 5.56
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lucy_ferrier_child",
      "text": "You hurt me when you put me down.",
      "shot": 5,
      "at": 29.208,
      "seconds": 2.11
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "A child of five came out of the shawl in a pink frock somebody had kept clean.",
      "shot": 6,
      "at": 31.833,
      "seconds": 5.06
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lucy_ferrier_child",
      "text": "Kiss it better. That is what mother does.",
      "shot": 7,
      "at": 37.417,
      "seconds": 2.89
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "He had been three days finding a way to tell her, and she asked him in four words.",
      "shot": 8,
      "at": 40.833,
      "seconds": 5.38
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "john_ferrier",
      "text": "Mother has gone on ahead. You will see her soon enough.",
      "shot": 9,
      "at": 46.75,
      "seconds": 3.49
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "She cried into her pinafore, and stopped, and wanted to know if they were going the same way.",
      "shot": 10,
      "at": 50.75,
      "seconds": 5.86
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lucy_ferrier_child",
      "text": "Do you mean we are going to die?",
      "shot": 11,
      "at": 57.125,
      "seconds": 2.31
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "He told her they were. She laughed out loud, and said he had frightened her for nothing.",
      "shot": 12,
      "at": 59.958,
      "seconds": 4.56
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "If they were dying, she said, then they were only going to where her mother already was.",
      "shot": 13,
      "at": 65.042,
      "seconds": 5.49
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Three specks came up out of the north and grew.",
      "shot": 14,
      "at": 71.042,
      "seconds": 3.56
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "They settled on the ledge above him, bald-headed and patient, and she clapped to make them fly.",
      "shot": 15,
      "at": 75.125,
      "seconds": 5.72
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lucy_ferrier_child",
      "text": "Somebody else made this part. They forgot to put the water in.",
      "shot": 16,
      "at": 81.375,
      "seconds": 4.06
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "She laid the shawl out and showed him how to kneel, because he had forgotten how.",
      "shot": 17,
      "at": 85.958,
      "seconds": 5.22
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "One voice thin and one deep, and nothing above them but the birds and the sky.",
      "shot": 18,
      "at": 91.708,
      "seconds": 5.52
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Then she slept on his chest, and his head came down on hers, and he slept too.",
      "shot": 19,
      "at": 97.75,
      "seconds": 5.82
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Half an hour later the far edge of the plain began to smoke.",
      "shot": 20,
      "at": 104.083,
      "seconds": 4.56
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Ten thousand people were coming west, with their waggons and their oxen and their guns.",
      "shot": 21,
      "at": 109.167,
      "seconds": 6.04
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Women walked at the wheels with bundles, and their children walked in the dust beside them.",
      "shot": 23,
      "at": 117.708,
      "seconds": 4.84
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Twenty grave men rode at the head of it, and they halted under the bluff.",
      "shot": 24,
      "at": 123.083,
      "seconds": 4.34
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Riders saw a scrap of pink on the crag, climbed with rifles ready, and came back astonished.",
      "shot": 25,
      "at": 127.958,
      "seconds": 6.32
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "john_ferrier",
      "text": "My name is John Ferrier. She is mine now. I am keeping her.",
      "shot": 26,
      "at": 134.792,
      "seconds": 5.27
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "The Prophet listened from his waggon seat, and gave them water on one condition.",
      "shot": 27,
      "at": 140.583,
      "seconds": 4.77
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "They could come as believers, he said, and he would carry no wolf in his fold.",
      "shot": 28,
      "at": 145.875,
      "seconds": 4.82
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Ferrier took a faith he had never heard of, the whips cracked, and the desert let them go.",
      "shot": 29,
      "at": 152.417,
      "seconds": 5.88
    }
  ]
}